{"id":"wb-7-1030","name":"双林三桥","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"双林三桥","text":"双林三桥位于浙江省湖州市南浔区双林镇北。万魁桥、化成桥、万元桥三桥同跨双林塘，均为三孔薄墩薄拱实腹石拱桥。2005年3月16日列入浙江省文物保护单位，2013年5月列入第七批全国重点文物保护单位。\n\n化成桥居三桥之中，为三桥中最早建成，始建于元延祐年间。\n\n万元桥距化成桥东225米处。\n\n万魁桥离化成桥西122米处。","shortened":true,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%8F%8C%E6%9E%97%E4%B8%89%E6%A1%A5","revisionId":92180182,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92180182","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/e15da952f2acd6ee23fae19a.jpg","title":"双林三桥_万元桥.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%8F%8C%E6%9E%97%E4%B8%89%E6%A1%A5_%E4%B8%87%E5%85%83%E6%A1%A5.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b9/%E5%8F%8C%E6%9E%97%E4%B8%89%E6%A1%A5_%E4%B8%87%E5%85%83%E6%A1%A5.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"三猎","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​双林三桥——万元桥。","width":320,"height":213},"textScope":"body-excerpt"}